    {
      "reviewbody": "The sound on this is very good for the era, but there are more inspired performances of these tunes out there.  Everything is very tasty, but nothing really grabs the attention.  Good overall, but mediocre for 1970.  If you only have time for one tune, listen to \"Me & My Uncle\". [we can't find the great performances if we rate everything as five stars]",
      "reviewtitle": "Good sound, decent performance",
