    {
      "reviewtitle": "Actually Winterland 10/04-05/70",
      "reviewbody": "Please cross-refer to the entry for \"12/17/70\" below,\n\nhttps://archive.org/details/gd1970-12-17.sbd.unk.87356.sbeok.flac16\n\nBoth of these sources are actually mislabelled variants on Winterland, October 4th & 5th 1970 - selected tracks from the multitrack tapes of these two October dates were mixed on 17th December and 23rd December 1970 (and mixdown reels labelled accordingly), which is where this dating confusion has crept in! \n\nFurther resources are available here,\nhttp://deadessays.blogspot.com/2010/10/mysterious-case-of-121770.html\n http://deadsources.blogspot.com/2013/06/october-4-5-1970-winterland-sf.html\n\n\nNevertheless, great music & hopefully we'll hear 10/04/70 and 10/05/70 complete in their multitrack glory one day...",
      "stars": "0",
      "reviewer": "PaulMc70",
      "reviewdate": "2020-10-05 13:27:10",
      "createdate": "2020-10-05 13:27:10",
      "reviewer_itemname": "@paulmc70"
    }
